@claude 
> The released Qwen3.5/3.6/3.8 indexes list the MTP head (mtp.*), even though torchtitan's Qwen35Model has none. 

Does that mean official Qwen models have MTP but torchtitan variants don't? That sounds a torchtitan model problem to fix, rather than a state dict loading problem? Could you comment from "first principles"?

@tivris 

could you help improve

> From first principles, the cleaner change is a shared filter in the save path rather than a fourth per-model one. I'd suggest the PR author make that change instead.

